  informationSource: North County Waterworks
  informationDescription: A surviving gatekeeper's visitor register contains handwritten entries for October 17, 1991. One entry records an after-hours arrival at the waterworks at approximately 6:40 PM under the name "F. Bell." The departure field is blank. The register does not establish who wrote the entry or whether the named visitor entered the lower service area.
